arameterId exists, otherwise it throws the error 10800.\r\nChecks if the given ParameterTargetValue, ParameterToleranceLow, ParameterToleranceHigh, ParameterLimitLow, ParameterLimitHigh values are of the same type than the given ParameterType value, otherwise it throws the error code 10835. \r\nIf the given Process Definition is different from an already defined Process Definition of the catalog parameter, the command checks:\r\n- if the given ProcessDefinitionNId exists, otherwise it throws the error 11210;\r\n- if the given argument SetToUseCurrentRevisionOfProcessDefinition is set to true, the catalog parameter property ProcessDefinitionRevision will be deleted; if not, the command controls that the given argument ProcessDefinitionRevision exists for the given ProcessDefinitionNId; otherwise it throws the error 10895.\r\nChecks if the given ParameterUoMNId exists, otherwise it throws the error 10803.\r\nIf the value of ParameterType is \"Quantity\", it verifies that there is a Unit of Measure; otherwise it throws the error 10007.","FullInfo":"Updates an existing instance of a catalog parameter.\r\nIf the value of an input parameter is empty or null, the respective property of the catalog parameter is not changed.\r\nChecks if the given ParameterId exists, otherwise it throws the error 10800.\r\nChecks if the given ParameterTargetValue, ParameterToleranceLow, ParameterToleranceHigh, ParameterLimitLow, ParameterLimitHigh values are of the same type than the given ParameterType value, otherwise it throws the error code 10835. \r\nIf the given Process Definition is different from an already defined Process Definition of the catalog parameter, the command checks:\r\n- if the given ProcessDefinitionNId exists, otherwise it throws the error 11210;\r\n- if the given argument SetToUseCurrentRevisionOfProcessDefinition is set to true, the catalog parameter property ProcessDefinitionRevision will be deleted; if not, the command controls that the given argument ProcessDefinitionRevision exists for the given ProcessDefinitionNId; otherwise it throws the error 10895.\r\nChecks if the given ParameterUoMNId exists, otherwise it throws the error 10803.\r\nIf the value of ParameterType is \"Quantity\", it verifies that there is a Unit of Measure; otherwise it throws the error 10007.","InfoMap":{"$id":"6079","FullIdObj":{"$id":"6080","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"Updates an existing instance of a catalog parameter.\r\nIf the value of an input parameter is empty or null, the respective property of the catalog parameter is not changed.\r\nChecks if the given ParameterId exists, otherwise it throws the error 10800.\r\nChecks if the given ParameterTargetValue, ParameterToleranceLow, ParameterToleranceHigh, ParameterLimitLow, ParameterLimitHigh values are of the same type than the given ParameterType value, otherwise it throws the error code 10835. \r\nIf the given Process Definition is different from an already defined Process Definition of the catalog parameter, the command checks:\r\n- if the given ProcessDefinitionNId exists, otherwise it throws the error 11210;\r\n- if the given argument SetToUseCurrentRevisionOfProcessDefinition is set to true, the catalog parameter property ProcessDefinitionRevision will be deleted; if not, the command controls that the given argument ProcessDefinitionRevision exists for the given ProcessDefinitionNId; otherwise it throws the error 10895.\r\nChecks if the given ParameterUoMNId exists, otherwise it throws the error 10803.\r\nIf the value of ParameterType is \"Quantity\", it verifies that there is a Unit of Measure; otherwise it throws the error 10007.","FullInfo":"Updates an existing instance of a catalog parameter.\r\nIf the value of an input parameter is empty or null, the respective property of the catalog parameter is not changed.\r\nChecks if the given ParameterId exists, otherwise it throws the error 10800.\r\nChecks if the given ParameterTargetValue, ParameterToleranceLow, ParameterToleranceHigh, ParameterLimitLow, ParameterLimitHigh values are of the same type than the given ParameterType value, otherwise it throws the error code 10835. \r\nIf the given Process Definition is different from an already defined Process Definition of the catalog parameter, the command checks:\r\n- if the given ProcessDefinitionNId exists, otherwise it throws the error 11210;\r\n- if the given argument SetToUseCurrentRevisionOfProcessDefinition is set to true, the catalog parameter property ProcessDefinitionRevision will be deleted; if not, the command controls that the given argument ProcessDefinitionRevision exists for the given ProcessDefinitionNId; otherwise it throws the error 10895.\r\nChecks if the given ParameterUoMNId exists, otherwise it throws the error 10803.\r\nIf the value of ParameterType is \"Quantity\", it verifies that there is a Unit of Measure; otherwise it throws the error 10007.","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"6080"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Updates an existing instance of a catalog parameter.\r\nIf the value of an input parameter is empty or null, the respective property of the catalog parameter is not changed.\r\nChecks if the given ParameterId exists, otherwise it throws the error 10800.\r\nChecks if the given ParameterTargetValue, ParameterToleranceLow, ParameterToleranceHigh, ParameterLimitLow, ParameterLimitHigh values are of the same type than the given ParameterType value, otherwise it throws the error code 10835. \r\nIf the given Process Definition is different from an already defined Process Definition of the catalog parameter, the command checks:\r\n- if the given ProcessDefinitionNId exists, otherwise it throws the error 11210;\r\n- if the given argument SetToUseCurrentRevisionOfProcessDefinition is set to true, the catalog parameter property ProcessDefinitionRevision will be deleted; if not, the command controls that the given argument ProcessDefinitionRevision exists for the given ProcessDefinitionNId; otherwise it throws the error 10895.\r\nChecks if the given ParameterUoMNId exists, otherwise it throws the error 10803.\r\nIf the value of ParameterType is \"Quantity\", it verifies that there is a Unit of Measure; otherwise it throws the error 10007.","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Updates an existing instance of a catalog parameter.\r\nIf the value of an input parameter is empty or null, the respective property of the catalog parameter is not changed.\r\nChecks if the given ParameterId exists, otherwise it throws the error 10800.\r\nChecks if the given ParameterTargetValue, ParameterToleranceLow, ParameterToleranceHigh, ParameterLimitLow, ParameterLimitHigh values are of the same type than the given ParameterType value, otherwise it throws the error code 10835. \r\nIf the given Process Definition is different from an already defined Process Definition of the catalog parameter, the command checks:\r\n- if the given ProcessDefinitionNId exists, otherwise it throws the error 11210;\r\n- if the given argument SetToUseCurrentRevisionOfProcessDefinition is set to true, the catalog parameter property ProcessDefinitionRevision will be deleted; if not, the command controls that the given argument ProcessDefinitionRevision exists for the given ProcessDefinitionNId; otherwise it throws the error 10895.\r\nChecks if the given ParameterUoMNId exists, otherwise it throws the error 10803.\r\nIf the value of ParameterType is \"Quantity\", it verifies that there is a Unit of Measure; otherwise it throws the error 10007."},"SystemAnnotations":[{"$id":"6081","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"Protected","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"5773"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Protected","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Protected"}],"CustomAnnotations":[{"$id":"6082","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"@Guid(05a8fd40-5ae5-446a-a108-9740f55a