.Commands.AddProcessParametersToWorkMasterHeader","InfoMap":{"$id":"6387","FullIdObj":{"$id":"6388","$type":"IdentificableObject","Guid":"9466a20c-8f22-41a4-8ca8-dffb3b9da18b","Name":"AddProcessParametersToWorkMasterHeader","FullInfo":"Siemens.SimaticIT.UAPI.MasterData.PICore_MS.MSModel.Commands.AddProcessParametersToWorkMasterHeader","TypeResolved":"","_project":{"$ref":"12"},"_domain":{"$ref":"5776"}}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"6388"},"Children":[],"Name":"CommandName","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"5773"},"Documentation":{"$id":"6389","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"Adds a set of process Parameters, taken from the Catalog, to a Work Master Header. \r\nFor each given Parameter, it is possible to override the Target Value.\r\nThe Command checks:\r\n1. if the given WorkMaster exists, if not error 10812 is returned;\r\n2. if the given WorkMaster is not Locked, if so error 10813 is returned;\r\n3. if the given process Parameters exist as catalog Parameters, if not error 10814 is returned;\r\n4. if the catalog Parameters are not already linked to the given WorkMaster, if so error 10836 is returned;\r\n5. if the given process Parameter values are compatible with the data type, if not the error 10836 is returned.","FullInfo":"Adds a set of process Parameters, taken from the Catalog, to a Work Master Header. \r\nFor each given Parameter, it is possible to override the Target Value.\r\nThe Command checks:\r\n1. if the given WorkMaster exists, if not error 10812 is returned;\r\n2. if the given WorkMaster is not Locked, if so error 10813 is returned;\r\n3. if the given process Parameters exist as catalog Parameters, if not error 10814 is returned;\r\n4. if the catalog Parameters are not already linked to the given WorkMaster, if so error 10836 is returned;\r\n5. if the given process Parameter values are compatible with the data type, if not the error 10836 is returned.","InfoMap":{"$id":"6390","FullIdObj":{"$id":"6391","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"Adds a set of process Parameters, taken from the Catalog, to a Work Master Header. \r\nFor each given Parameter, it is possible to override the Target Value.\r\nThe Command checks:\r\n1. if the given WorkMaster exists, if not error 10812 is returned;\r\n2. if the given WorkMaster is not Locked, if so error 10813 is returned;\r\n3. if the given process Parameters exist as catalog Parameters, if not error 10814 is returned;\r\n4. if the catalog Parameters are not already linked to the given WorkMaster, if so error 10836 is returned;\r\n5. if the given process Parameter values are compatible with the data type, if not the error 10836 is returned.","FullInfo":"Adds a set of process Parameters, taken from the Catalog, to a Work Master Header. \r\nFor each given Parameter, it is possible to override the Target Value.\r\nThe Command checks:\r\n1. if the given WorkMaster exists, if not error 10812 is returned;\r\n2. if the given WorkMaster is not Locked, if so error 10813 is returned;\r\n3. if the given process Parameters exist as catalog Parameters, if not error 10814 is returned;\r\n4. if the catalog Parameters are not already linked to the given WorkMaster, if so error 10836 is returned;\r\n5. if the given process Parameter values are compatible with the data type, if not the error 10836 is returned.","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"6391"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Adds a set of process Parameters, taken from the Catalog, to a Work Master Header. \r\nFor each given Parameter, it is possible to override the Target Value.\r\nThe Command checks:\r\n1. if the given WorkMaster exists, if not error 10812 is returned;\r\n2. if the given WorkMaster is not Locked, if so error 10813 is returned;\r\n3. if the given process Parameters exist as catalog Parameters, if not error 10814 is returned;\r\n4. if the catalog Parameters are not already linked to the given WorkMaster, if so error 10836 is returned;\r\n5. if the given process Parameter values are compatible with the data type, if not the error 10836 is returned.","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Adds a set of process Parameters, taken from the Catalog, to a Work Master Header. \r\nFor each given Parameter, it is possible to override the Target Value.\r\nThe Command checks:\r\n1. if the given WorkMaster exists, if not error 10812 is returned;\r\n2. if the given WorkMaster is not Locked, if so error 10813 is returned;\r\n3. if the given process Parameters exist as catalog Parameters, if not error 10814 is returned;\r\n4. if the catalog Parameters are not already linked to the given WorkMaster, if so error 10836 is returned;\r\n5. if the given process Parameter values are compatible with the data type, if not the error 10836 is returned."},"SystemAnnotations":[{"$id":"6392","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"Protected","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"5773"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Protected","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Protected"}],"CustomAnnotations":[{"$id":"6393","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"@Guid(9466a20c-8f22-41a4-8ca8-dffb3b9da18b)","FullInfo":"@Guid(9466a20c-8f22-41a4-8ca8-dffb3b9da18b)","InfoMap":{"$id":"6394","FullIdObj":{"$id":"6395","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"@Guid(9466a20c-8f22-41a4-8ca8-dffb3b9da18b)","FullInfo":"@Guid(9466a20c-8f22-41a4-8ca8-dffb3b9da18b)","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"6395"},"Children":[],"Name":"CustomAnnotation","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"5773"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"@Guid(9466a20c-8f22-41a4-8ca8-dffb3b9da18b)","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"@Guid(9466a20c-8f22-41a4-8ca8-dffb3b9da18b)"}],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"AddProcessParametersToWorkMasterHeader","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"AddProcessParametersToWorkMasterHeader"},{"$id":"6396","$type":"DslCommandInputDeclarationTree","Children":[{