nfo":{"$ref":"5773"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"COMMAND","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"COMMAND"},{"$id":"8021","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"UpdateOperationEquipmentSpecification","FullInfo":"Siemens.SimaticIT.UAPI.MasterData.PICore_MS.MSModel.Commands.UpdateOperationEquipmentSpecification","InfoMap":{"$id":"8022","FullIdObj":{"$id":"8023","$type":"IdentificableObject","Guid":"d2b406dd-0918-417b-8cda-7f22374f2774","Name":"UpdateOperationEquipmentSpecification","FullInfo":"Siemens.SimaticIT.UAPI.MasterData.PICore_MS.MSModel.Commands.UpdateOperationEquipmentSpecification","TypeResolved":"","_project":{"$ref":"12"},"_domain":{"$ref":"5776"}}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"8023"},"Children":[],"Name":"CommandName","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"5773"},"Documentation":{"$id":"8024","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"Updates the Sequence number, Requirement Tag and IsMain Properties of the Operation Equipment Specification. \r\n\r\nThe command will: \r\n1. retrieve the Work Master Operation and the Work Master; \r\n2. check if the Work Master can be edited; \r\n3. update the Work Master Operation Equipment Specification according to the given command inputs. \r\n\r\nThe command checks if the given Work Master Operation exists, If not error -10300 is returned. \r\nThe command checks if the Work Master associated to the given Work Master Operation is locked for editing, If so, error -10813 is returned. \r\nThe command checks if the Operation Equipment Specification specifies an Equipment Group identifier when the IsMain Property is set to True, If not error -10899 is returned ","FullInfo":"Updates the Sequence number, Requirement Tag and IsMain Properties of the Operation Equipment Specification. \r\n\r\nThe command will: \r\n1. retrieve the Work Master Operation and the Work Master; \r\n2. check if the Work Master can be edited; \r\n3. update the Work Master Operation Equipment Specification according to the given command inputs. \r\n\r\nThe command checks if the given Work Master Operation exists, If not error -10300 is returned. \r\nThe command checks if the Work Master associated to the given Work Master Operation is locked for editing, If so, error -10813 is returned. \r\nThe command checks if the Operation Equipment Specification specifies an Equipment Group identifier when the IsMain Property is set to True, If not error -10899 is returned ","InfoMap":{"$id":"8025","FullIdObj":{"$id":"8026","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"Updates the Sequence number, Requirement Tag and IsMain Properties of the Operation Equipment Specification. \r\n\r\nThe command will: \r\n1. retrieve the Work Master Operation and the Work Master; \r\n2. check if the Work Master can be edited; \r\n3. update the Work Master Operation Equipment Specification according to the given command inputs. \r\n\r\nThe command checks if the given Work Master Operation exists, If not error -10300 is returned. \r\nThe command checks if the Work Master associated to the given Work Master Operation is locked for editing, If so, error -10813 is returned. \r\nThe command checks if the Operation Equipment Specification specifies an Equipment Group identifier when the IsMain Property is set to True, If not error -10899 is returned ","FullInfo":"Updates the Sequence number, Requirement Tag and IsMain Properties of the Operation Equipment Specification. \r\n\r\nThe command will: \r\n1. retrieve the Work Master Operation and the Work Master; \r\n2. check if the Work Master can be edited; \r\n3. update the Work Master Operation Equipment Specification according to the given command inputs. \r\n\r\nThe command checks if the given Work Master Operation exists, If not error -10300 is returned. \r\nThe command checks if the Work Master associated to the given Work Master Operation is locked for editing, If so, error -10813 is returned. \r\nThe command checks if the Operation Equipment Specification specifies an Equipment Group identifier when the IsMain Property is set to True, If not error -10899 is returned ","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"8026"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Updates the Sequence number, Requirement Tag and IsMain Properties of the Operation Equipment Specification. \r\n\r\nThe command will: \r\n1. retrieve the Work Master Operation and the Work Master; \r\n2. check if the Work Master can be edited; \r\n3. update the Work Master Operation Equipment Specification according to the given command inputs. \r\n\r\nThe command checks if the given Work Master Operation exists, If not error -10300 is returned. \r\nThe command checks if the Work Master associated to the given Work Master Operation is locked for editing, If so, error -10813 is returned. \r\nThe command checks if the Operation Equipment Specification specifies an Equipment Group identifier when the IsMain Property is set to True, If not error -10899 is returned ","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Updates the Sequence number, Requirement Tag and IsMain Properties of the Operation Equipment Specification. \r\n\r\nThe command will: \r\n1. retrieve the Work Master Operation and the Work Master; \r\n2. check if the Work Master can be edited; \r\n3. update the Work Master Operation Equipment Specification according to the given command inputs. \r\n\r\nThe command checks if the given Work Master Operation exists, If not error -10300 is returned. \r\nThe command checks if the Work Master associated to the given Work Master Operation is locked for editing, If so, error -10813 is returned. \r\nThe command checks if the Operation Equipment Specification specifies an Equipment Group identifier when the IsMain Property is set to True, If not error -10899 is returned "},"SystemAnnotations":[{"$id":"8027","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"Protected","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"5773"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"Cu