set of Parameter Specifications to a Work Master Operation by copying all the parameters of a Process Definition.\r\nYou can override the target value of each parameter.\r\nThis command creates one Parameter Specification per Process Definition Parameter except if this Process Definition Parameter resulted from importing a Catalog Parameter to the Process Definition.\r\nWhen importing a Catalog Parameter in a Process Definition, a set of Process Definition parameters can be generated, representing the limits and tolerances of the imported Catalog Parameter.\r\nIf it is the case, this command creates only one Parameter Specification that will be defined with the target values of the related Process Definition parameters, each target value being either a limit or a tolerance of the Parameter Specification to be created.","FullInfo":"Adds a set of Parameter Specifications to a Work Master Operation by copying all the parameters of a Process Definition.\r\nYou can override the target value of each parameter.\r\nThis command creates one Parameter Specification per Process Definition Parameter except if this Process Definition Parameter resulted from importing a Catalog Parameter to the Process Definition.\r\nWhen importing a Catalog Parameter in a Process Definition, a set of Process Definition parameters can be generated, representing the limits and tolerances of the imported Catalog Parameter.\r\nIf it is the case, this command creates only one Parameter Specification that will be defined with the target values of the related Process Definition parameters, each target value being either a limit or a tolerance of the Parameter Specification to be created.","InfoMap":{"$id":"9888","FullIdObj":{"$id":"9889","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"Adds a set of Parameter Specifications to a Work Master Operation by copying all the parameters of a Process Definition.\r\nYou can override the target value of each parameter.\r\nThis command creates one Parameter Specification per Process Definition Parameter except if this Process Definition Parameter resulted from importing a Catalog Parameter to the Process Definition.\r\nWhen importing a Catalog Parameter in a Process Definition, a set of Process Definition parameters can be generated, representing the limits and tolerances of the imported Catalog Parameter.\r\nIf it is the case, this command creates only one Parameter Specification that will be defined with the target values of the related Process Definition parameters, each target value being either a limit or a tolerance of the Parameter Specification to be created.","FullInfo":"Adds a set of Parameter Specifications to a Work Master Operation by copying all the parameters of a Process Definition.\r\nYou can override the target value of each parameter.\r\nThis command creates one Parameter Specification per Process Definition Parameter except if this Process Definition Parameter resulted from importing a Catalog Parameter to the Process Definition.\r\nWhen importing a Catalog Parameter in a Process Definition, a set of Process Definition parameters can be generated, representing the limits and tolerances of the imported Catalog Parameter.\r\nIf it is the case, this command creates only one Parameter Specification that will be defined with the target values of the related Process Definition parameters, each target value being either a limit or a tolerance of the Parameter Specification to be created.","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"9889"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Adds a set of Parameter Specifications to a Work Master Operation by copying all the parameters of a Process Definition.\r\nYou can override the target value of each parameter.\r\nThis command creates one Parameter Specification per Process Definition Parameter except if this Process Definition Parameter resulted from importing a Catalog Parameter to the Process Definition.\r\nWhen importing a Catalog Parameter in a Process Definition, a set of Process Definition parameters can be generated, representing the limits and tolerances of the imported Catalog Parameter.\r\nIf it is the case, this command creates only one Parameter Specification that will be defined with the target values of the related Process Definition parameters, each target value being either a limit or a tolerance of the Parameter Specification to be created.","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Adds a set of Parameter Specifications to a Work Master Operation by copying all the parameters of a Process Definition.\r\nYou can override the target value of each parameter.\r\nThis command creates one Parameter Specification per Process Definition Parameter except if this Process Definition Parameter resulted from importing a Catalog Parameter to the Process Definition.\r\nWhen importing a Catalog Parameter in a Process Definition, a set of Process Definition parameters can be generated, representing the limits and tolerances of the imported Catalog Parameter.\r\nIf it is the case, this command creates only one Parameter Specification that will be defined with the target values of the related Process Definition parameters, each target value being either a limit or a tolerance of the Parameter Specification to be created."},"SystemAnnotations":[{"$id":"9890","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"Protected","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"5773"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Protected","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Protected"}],"CustomAnnotations":[{"$id":"9891","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"@Guid(f4bfc2b2-24f9-450e-b046-227c0108c5d2)","FullInfo":"@Guid(f4bfc2b2-24f9-450e-b046-227c0108c5d2)","InfoMap":{"$id":"9892","FullIdObj":{"$id":"9893","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"@Guid(f4bfc2b2-24f9-450e-b046-227c0108c5d2)","FullInfo":"@Guid(f4bfc2b2-24f9-450e-b046-227c0108c5d2)","TypeResolved":""