 Work Master by copying a Work Master Operation from another Work Master.  \r\nThe new Work Master Operation is created with all requested Specifications of the Work Master Operation of origin: Parameter Specifications, Material Specifications, and Equipment Specifications. \r\n\r\nThe AssociateOperationsToWorkMaster Command is first called to create the Work Master Operation without specifications. \r\n\r\n The command checks if the given Work Master Operation exists, if not error 10300 is returned. ","InfoMap":{"$id":"10149","FullIdObj":{"$id":"10150","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"Adds a Work Master Operation to a Work Master by copying a Work Master Operation from another Work Master.  \r\nThe new Work Master Operation is created with all requested Specifications of the Work Master Operation of origin: Parameter Specifications, Material Specifications, and Equipment Specifications. \r\n\r\nThe AssociateOperationsToWorkMaster Command is first called to create the Work Master Operation without specifications. \r\n\r\n The command checks if the given Work Master Operation exists, if not error 10300 is returned. ","FullInfo":"Adds a Work Master Operation to a Work Master by copying a Work Master Operation from another Work Master.  \r\nThe new Work Master Operation is created with all requested Specifications of the Work Master Operation of origin: Parameter Specifications, Material Specifications, and Equipment Specifications. \r\n\r\nThe AssociateOperationsToWorkMaster Command is first called to create the Work Master Operation without specifications. \r\n\r\n The command checks if the given Work Master Operation exists, if not error 10300 is returned. ","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"10150"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Adds a Work Master Operation to a Work Master by copying a Work Master Operation from another Work Master.  \r\nThe new Work Master Operation is created with all requested Specifications of the Work Master Operation of origin: Parameter Specifications, Material Specifications, and Equipment Specifications. \r\n\r\nThe AssociateOperationsToWorkMaster Command is first called to create the Work Master Operation without specifications. \r\n\r\n The command checks if the given Work Master Operation exists, if not error 10300 is returned. ","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Adds a Work Master Operation to a Work Master by copying a Work Master Operation from another Work Master.  \r\nThe new Work Master Operation is created with all requested Specifications of the Work Master Operation of origin: Parameter Specifications, Material Specifications, and Equipment Specifications. \r\n\r\nThe AssociateOperationsToWorkMaster Command is first called to create the Work Master Operation without specifications. \r\n\r\n The command checks if the given Work Master Operation exists, if not error 10300 is returned. "},"SystemAnnotations":[{"$id":"10151","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"Protected","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"5773"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Protected","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Protected"}],"CustomAnnotations":[{"$id":"10152","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"@Guid(4eb4c882-2af5-4967-9377-8df0653a7f34)","FullInfo":"@Guid(4eb4c882-2af5-4967-9377-8df0653a7f34)","InfoMap":{"$id":"10153","FullIdObj":{"$id":"10154","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"@Guid(4eb4c882-2af5-4967-9377-8df0653a7f34)","FullInfo":"@Guid(4eb4c882-2af5-4967-9377-8df0653a7f34)","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"10154"},"Children":[],"Name":"CustomAnnotation","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"5773"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"@Guid(4eb4c882-2af5-4967-9377-8df0653a7f34)","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"@Guid(4eb4c882-2af5-4967-9377-8df0653a7f34)"}],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"AddWorkMas