ror codes, if some checks on input parameters fail:\r\n* Error -10300: the State Machine, identified by StateMachineNId, does not exist.\r\n* Error -11320: the State Machine does not contain statuses.\r\n* Error -10984: the initial status does not exist in the State Machine.\r\n* Error -10300: the Equipment Configuration, identified by EquipmentNId, does not exist.\r\n* Error -10316: the Name parameter is empty.","InfoMap":{"$id":"10410","FullIdObj":{"$id":"10411","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"Creates a Work Master Operation from scratch and associates it to the Work Master.  \r\nThe new Work Master Operation is created without Specifications and Process Definitions.\r\n\r\nThe AssociateOperationsToWorkMaster Command is first called to create the Work Master Operation without specifications.\r\n\r\nThe command may return the following error codes, if some checks on input parameters fail:\r\n* Error -10300: the State Machine, identified by StateMachineNId, does not exist.\r\n* Error -11320: the State Machine does not contain statuses.\r\n* Error -10984: the initial status does not exist in the State Machine.\r\n* Error -10300: the Equipment Configuration, identified by EquipmentNId, does not exist.\r\n* Error -10316: the Name parameter is empty.","FullInfo":"Creates a Work Master Operation from scratch and associates it to the Work Master.  \r\nThe new Work Master Operation is created without Specifications and Process Definitions.\r\n\r\nThe AssociateOperationsToWorkMaster Command is first called to create the Work Master Operation without specifications.\r\n\r\nThe command may return the following error codes, if some checks on input parameters fail:\r\n* Error -10300: the State Machine, identified by StateMachineNId, does not exist.\r\n* Error -11320: the State Machine does not contain statuses.\r\n* Error -10984: the initial status does not exist in the State Machine.\r\n* Error -10300: the Equipment Configuration, identified by EquipmentNId, does not exist.\r\n* Error -10316: the Name parameter is empty.","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"10411"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Creates a Work Master Operation from scratch and associates it to the Work Master.  \r\nThe new Work Master Operation is created without Specifications and Process Definitions.\r\n\r\nThe AssociateOperationsToWorkMaster Command is first called to create the Work Master Operation without specifications.\r\n\r\nThe command may return the following error codes, if some checks on input parameters fail:\r\n* Error -10300: the State Machine, identified by StateMachineNId, does not exist.\r\n* Error -11320: the State Machine does not contain statuses.\r\n* Error -10984: the initial status does not exist in the State Machine.\r\n* Error -10300: the Equipment Configuration, identified by EquipmentNId, does not exist.\r\n* Error -10316: the Name parameter is empty.","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Creates a Work Master Operation from scratch and associates it to the Work Master.  \r\nThe new Work Master Operation is created without Specifications and Process Definitions.\r\n\r\nThe AssociateOperationsToWorkMaster Command is first called to create the Work Master Operation without specifications.\r\n\r\nThe command may return the following error codes, if some checks on input parameters fail:\r\n* Error -10300: the State Machine, identified by StateMachineNId, does not exist.\r\n* Error -11320: the State Machine does not contain statuses.\r\n* Error -10984: the initial status does not exist in the State Machine.\r\n* Error -10300: the Equipment Configuration, identified by EquipmentNId, does not exist.\r\n* Error -10316: the Name parameter is empty."},"SystemAnnotations":[{"$id":"10412","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"Protected","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"5773"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],