 Entity will be used at runtime, the system will search for the Current Revision of the Material in that moment.\r\n\r\nThe Command performs the following checks:\r\n* If BoM Material does not exists, it returns the error -10806\r\n* If __TemplateNId__ does not exists, it returns the error -3\r\n* If __BoMItemNId__ does not exists, it returns the error -2","FullInfo":"Creates a new Bill of Materials with Bill of Material Items and assigns to it a list of Segregation Tags.\r\nIf you call the Command with the same __NId__ and __Revision__ the Command deletes the old ones and creates again the Entity with the new data.\r\nIf __TemplateNId__ is null or empty, the Command uses the BoM Template marked as Default.\r\nIf __MaterialRevision__ is null or empty when this Entity will be used at runtime, the system will search for the Current Revision of the Material in that moment.\r\n\r\nThe Command performs the following checks:\r\n* If BoM Material does not exists, it returns the error -10806\r\n* If __TemplateNId__ does not exists, it returns the error -3\r\n* If __BoMItemNId__ does not exists, it returns the error -2","InfoMap":{"$id":"11086","FullIdObj":{"$id":"11087","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"Creates a new Bill of Materials with Bill of Material Items and assigns to it a list of Segregation Tags.\r\nIf you call the Command with the same __NId__ and __Revision__ the Command deletes the old ones and creates again the Entity with the new data.\r\nIf __TemplateNId__ is null or empty, the Command uses the BoM Template marked as Default.\r\nIf __MaterialRevision__ is null or empty when this Entity will be used at runtime, the system will search for the Current Revision of the Material in that moment.\r\n\r\nThe Command performs the following checks:\r\n* If BoM Material does not exists, it returns the error -10806\r\n* If __TemplateNId__ does not exists, it returns the error -3\r\n* If __BoMItemNId__ does not exists, it returns the error -2","FullInfo":"Creates a new Bill of Materials with Bill of Material Items and assigns to it a list of Segregation Tags.\r\nIf you call the Command with the same __NId__ and __Revision__ the Command deletes the old ones and creates again the Entity with the new data.\r\nIf __TemplateNId__ is null or empty, the Command uses the BoM Template marked as Default.\r\nIf __MaterialRevision__ is null or empty when this Entity will be used at runtime, the system will search for the Current Revision of the Material in that moment.\r\n\r\nThe Command performs the following checks:\r\n* If BoM Material does not exists, it returns the error -10806\r\n* If __TemplateNId__ does not exists, it returns the error -3\r\n* If __BoMItemNId__ does not exists, it returns the error -2","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"11087"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Creates a new Bill of Materials with Bill of Material Items and assigns to it a list of Segregation Tags.\r\nIf you call the Command with the same __NId__ and __Revision__ the Command deletes the old ones and creates again the Entity with the new data.\r\nIf __TemplateNId__ is null or empty, the Command uses the BoM Template marked as Default.\r\nIf __MaterialRevision__ is null or empty when this Entity will be used at runtime, the system will search for the Current Revision of the Material in that moment.\r\n\r\nThe Command performs the following checks:\r\n* If BoM Material does not exists, it returns the error -10806\r\n* If __TemplateNId__ does not exists, it returns the error -3\r\n* If __BoMItemNId__ does not exists, it returns the error -2","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Creates a new Bill of Materials with Bill of Material Items and assigns to it a list of Segregation Tags.\r\nIf you call the Command with the same __NId__ and __Revision__ the Command deletes the old ones and creates again the Entity with the new data.\r\nIf __TemplateNId__ is null or emp